1. EC2 Pricing Basics

EC2 mein cost mainly instance ke running time, computing resources, storage aur applicable data transfer se related hoti hai.

EC2 instance Running hone par compute usage count hota hai.

EC2 instance Stopped hone par compute charges generally stop ho jaate hain, lekin attached EBS storage ke charges continue ho sakte hain.

Important:

EC2 Running → Compute usage
EC2 Stopped → Compute usage generally stops
EBS → Storage charges may continue

Free Tier ki applicable limits ke andar eligible usage par charge nahi lag sakta.

2. Elastic IP

Elastic IP ek static public IPv4 address hai.

Normal Public IPv4 stop/start ke baad change ho sakta hai.

Elastic IP ko EC2 ke saath associate karne par same public IP retain kiya ja sakta hai.

Normal Public IPv4 → Change ho sakta hai

Elastic IP → Static Public IPv4

Elastic IP ko unnecessarily allocate nahi karna chahiye, kyunki public IPv4 usage par AWS ke current pricing rules ke according charges apply ho sakte hain.

3. EBS Deep Basics

EBS stands for Elastic Block Store.

EBS EC2 instance ke liye persistent block storage provide karta hai.

Simple idea:

EC2 → Server
EBS → Storage

EBS Volume ko virtual hard disk ki tarah samajh sakte hain.

EC2 stop hone ke baad EBS volume ka data normally preserved rehta hai.

EC2 launch karte waqt attached root EBS volume mein operating system aur system files stored hote hain.

4. EBS Snapshot

EBS Snapshot EBS volume ka point-in-time backup hota hai.

Simple idea:

EBS Volume
     ↓
Snapshot
     ↓
Backup

Snapshot ka use future mein data restore ya new EBS volume create karne ke liye kiya ja sakta hai.

5. EC2 vs Traditional Server

Traditional Server ek physical server hota hai jiske hardware ko organization ko manage karna padta hai.

EC2 AWS infrastructure par running virtual server hai.

Traditional Server → Physical Server

EC2 → Cloud-based Virtual Server

EC2 mein physical hardware, power aur data-center infrastructure AWS manage karta hai.

User EC2 ke andar operating system, software aur configuration manage karta hai.

