7. SSH and EC2

SSH stands for Secure Shell.

SSH ke through local computer se remotely Ubuntu EC2 instance mein securely connect kar sakte hain.

Basic command:

ssh -i key.pem ubuntu@PUBLIC-IP

Important:

PowerShell → Local Windows Terminal

SSH → Secure Connection Method

EC2 → Remote Virtual Server

SSH connection successful hone ke baad "ubuntu@ip-...:~$" prompt ka matlab hai ki commands EC2 Ubuntu server par execute ho rahi hain.

8. EC2 Instance States

Running

EC2 instance active hai aur compute resources use kar raha hai.

Stopped

Instance temporarily stopped hai. Compute usage generally stop ho jata hai, lekin EBS storage remain karta hai.

Terminated

Instance permanently deleted ho jata hai.

Running → Stopped → Running

Running → Terminated

